WEBVTT

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:35.250
When the Girl's World Changes

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.880
This is a very necessary checkup.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:44.580
You've weathered out the drug and
acquired the ability to use mana,

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.580
but we can't discard the possibility that
you've developed physical abnormalities.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.040
Now, lie face up.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.080
Instructor...

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:08.880
You don't seem at all mindful of the fact that I'm a girl.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.330
I wouldn't say that.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.790
You know, I actually feel embarrassed doing this.

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:17.750
It's just that I've trained myself
not to let my feelings show.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.750
I-if you really are embarrassed,
then why do something like this?

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:28.630
You might find this strange seeing as we've just met,
but I'm doing it because I care about you.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:38.460
When I think about the possibility - however tiny it
may be - that what I did has caused you bodily harm,

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.000
the thought of it is so dreadful I can't even sleep at night.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.830
Now, there is just one thing I wish for...

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.630
That, milady, you remain healthy and full of vigor.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.250
That's all I ask.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.420
My apologies, Instructor.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.080
If there are any areas you need to check,
please feel free to touch me there.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.080
Thank you.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:13.080
By the way, there's one more important
thing I need to speak to you about.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:20.750
To tell the truth, milady, the class you've
attained is unfortunately not Paladin.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:21.880
Huh?

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:24.210
So, then...

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.960
Your class is Samurai - the same as mine.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.670
"Samurai"...

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:34.920
I see.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.250
Although it's a bit unfortunate
I couldn't become a Paladin...

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.580
I'm happy to share the same class as you, Instructor.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.540
I'm glad you've come to terms with it.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:51.420
It might be advisable for you to keep this
matter secret from everyone for the time being.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.080
Why is that?

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:58.460
Because, given your position, there would surely
be someone who starts unsavory rumors about you.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:05.330
Seeing as I shared my mana with her,
this is the natural outcome.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:13.500
But, I just hope milady can establish a track
record befitting a member of an aristocratic House.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:19.420
This is the sole path forward that will
allow milady and me to survive.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.670
Instructor, if that's what you think is best, I'll do it.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.420
You're all done now.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.960
In every respect, both internally and externally,
your body is free from aftereffects.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.540
That's a relief.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.130
Instructor...

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.080
Am I going to be able to become your pupil?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.580
Milady, it is my great pleasure
to already count you as my pupil.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.080
I'm looking forward to going to school.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.380
After all, now I have mana!

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.880
I've been designated with a great Class, too!

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.000
I'm not the least bit different from
everyone else at school now!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.630
I forgot to tell you...
Friends! Friends!

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.750
Until the public tournament one week from today,

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:12.790
I'm forbidding you to use any mana
outside of your lessons with me.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:13.670
Huh?

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.210
The tournament is coming up soon.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.880
Ah, I'm getting nervous about it already.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.500
Well, we've got Nerva on our side, so we'll be fine.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:27.630
My, my...

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.920
You know, I've been wanting to read this book.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.250
What? It's fine if I have it, right?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.080
After all, the two of us are friends.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.420
Come on, Melida, hurry up and get changed.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.830
We're going to go train.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.250
I, uh...

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:49.920
Oh, I see.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.540
Fine, then.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.960
You've saved me some trouble - that's one less burden.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:59.670
Seems that lessons with her tutor are
more important to Melida than her friends.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.290
She's quite heartless, isn't she?

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:02.960
Sure is!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.330
No kidding!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.170
It's a shame considering I'm finally able to use mana now.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:17.580
You've only just awakened your ability,
so it's currently still imperfect.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.380
I know that...

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.420
The fateful day is a week from now.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:27.380
Until then, keep giving even your school
friends the wrong idea about you.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.130
If you can do that, those girls will witness an
unprecedent miracle before their very eyes.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.130
Understood, Instructor.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.040
Be that as it may...

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:41.830
Do you people over there spying on us
have some kind of business with milady?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.250
Hi there.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.420
Elli...

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.880
Um, about before...

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.130
Seems we meet again, Mr. Perfect Gentleman!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:06:59.500
So it was you, huh?

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:04.750
Uh, Instructor, who might that be?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:05.920
Nice to meet you!

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:12.040
I'm Rosetti Pricket, and I've recently
become Lady Elise's private tutor.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:16.710
"Rosetti"... Are you truly THAT Rosetti Pricket?!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.880
Wow, you say that just like I'm famous.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:24.380
Not "just like" - you actually are famous.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.790
That's because, despite being born in
the lower-social-stratum living quarters,

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.960
she awakened her mana at a very young age.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:33.880
And not only did she succeed in being
the youngest ever to join Crest Legion,

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:39.000
she was also granted the special title of
Career Marquess by His Majesty the King.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.790
People are always exaggerating my achievements,

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.500
but don't mind any of that and just
call me "Rose," Lady Melida.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.080
O-okay!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:54.290
Actually, I've also heard a bit about
you from Lady Elise, Mr. Kufa Vampir!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.210
Seeing as we're both employees of the
House of Angel and both private tutors...

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.420
I hope we can get along!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.380
Huh?!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.380
I'm sorry...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.500
But I cannot afford the luxury of getting along with you.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.250
Wh-why?!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:19.580
Because a blithe woman such as yourself would
have a bad influence on Lady Melida's education.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.460
What do you mean "blithe"?!

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:25.040
I don't believe this - last time we met
you were so kind and gentlemanly!

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:29.420
Not only the young ladies, but also those in charge
of their education are subject to public comparison.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.250
Hmph!

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:32.420
I'll show you!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:39.710
My young lady is going to trounce
your Lady Melida at the tournament!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.880
You got that?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.500
Instructor Rose...

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.710
Come on, let's head home, milady.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:01.080
The big day has finally arrived.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:06.040
Instructor... I'm scared.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.540
I want to get out of here.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.540
It will be alright.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.580
After all, you've trained thoroughly leading up to today.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.670
But, there's such a huge crowd of people...

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.670
Father...

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:44.580
I... don't have any confidence in myself.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:48.880
Milady, it is about time for me to head to the stands.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.830
What is to be done?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.580
As things stand, she can only
manifest half her power at best.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:57.500
Oh, Melida!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:59.630
I heard the news.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.250
It seems Yuffie's unit took you on.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.040
Y-yeah.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.670
I pity your family.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:15.380
To think they have to watch as you embarrass
yourself in front of a crowd and get laughed at!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:20.580
Seriously, why is a girl like you
even a student at our academy?

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:24.130
You're so unsightly that, as a friend,
I can't bear watching you.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:26.670
Lady Nerva.

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.670
With all due respect, I have a favor to ask.

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.290
Why, Instructor, please go
ahead and ask anything of me.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.460
Thank you.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.580
In that case...

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:44.420
My ears can't take any more of your jabbering,
so can you please shut up?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.710
You monkey girl.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:50.170
How dare you say something like that to me!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.540
You don't know the first thing about Lady Melida.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:57.880
Has a nameless noble like yourself gotten
carried away now that he's employed by a duke?

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.670
Hmph!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.080
You call yourself a private tutor.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:05.880
But I bet you just read her picture
books and collect your salary!

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:13.080
He's the very best tutor around!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.250
I'm not about to let you get away with mocking him!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.080
I'm gonna completely destroy you in the tournament!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.500
Now you've gone and said it! You hopeless failure.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:26.420
Well then, I'm looking forward to this.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:38.920
I've gone and done it now!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.000
What should I do? What should I do? What should I do?

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.830
Seems milady...
What should I do? What should I do? What should I do?

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.080
Is the type who's able to summon
her strength not for own sake,

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.500
but for the sake of others.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:54.500
Look, even Sir Felgus Angel is in attendance.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.540
And next to him... Is that Lord Mordrew?

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.670
That's her grandfather - Lady Melida's, I mean.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.540
Ah, the girl who rumor has it can't use mana...

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.540
To put it in the extreme,

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.130
depending on the results of this tournament...

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:17.790
it is possible that both milady
and I will end up being disposed of.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.250
Seems you're feeling the pressure,
Mr. Black-Hearted Sham Gentleman.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.000
Ah, if it isn't Ms. Prick.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.420
My name's "Pricket," okay?!

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:26.750
Something I can do for you?

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.000
My Lady Elise was concerned...

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.000
About Lady Melida, that is.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.960
Melida, there's no need for you to do anything, okay?

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.420
Just leave everything to us.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:40.790
B-But...!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:48.790
And now...

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:53.670
I present the St. Friedeswiede Girls' Academy
end-of-semester public tournament...

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.080
Let the first match begin!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.670
Charge!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.580
Melida...?

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.040
Instructor, please watch me now!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:23.540
I'm so happy that it's YOU who
is the first to come greet me!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.880
If you want to stand out that badly, I'll help you out!

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.380
By making this the final stage of the
"incompetent talented girl"!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:36.040
I'll pummel up each of your limbs and
make you shamefully grovel before me!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.330
Melida Angel...

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.040
Can use mana?!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.290
Lady Melida just used mana!

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:05.130
That right there is the warrior
who you all called worthless!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.250
Why are you acting all proud of yourself?

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:13.130
The little baby simply learned how to use a tool is all!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.750
Just because your opponent has a weapon doesn't
mean that's necessarily what they'll attack with.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:24.290
Y-you little...!

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.540
I, of all people...

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.380
I, of all people...

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:40.130
ending up like this!

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.880
It's Melida Angel we're talking about here...

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.500
It's just Melida Angel...

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.250
Just Melida Angel...

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.750
It's only that damn Melida Angel!

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.670
Garrick Hammer!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:25.460
Dear me, was that too intense for a wee
babe who's only just learned to use mana?

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.420
But, we are friends, after all.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:35.500
If you surrender, I'll spare you further suffering.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:38.960
...were more frightening.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.290
Huh? Say what?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:45.040
Sorry, but I didn't catch a word of that.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.080
I'll hear what you have to say in the nurse's office.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.420
I said, "Instructor's attacks were more frightening."

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:08.920
She must be in pain, right?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.790
Yes.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:13.750
However, compared to the pain
she's experienced up till now...

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.920
it might hardly register.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:22.540
Don't mess around with me...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.210
you damn incompetent talented girl!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.920
The mana's been used up?!
The mana's been used up?!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.130
You got too cocky!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:50.250
Funny, isn't it, Melida?!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.540
That's right!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:56.210
Turning tail and running away like that really suits you!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.420
"Instructor's attacks were more frightening"...?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.630
Take that back!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.210
In truth, I'm the one who's frightening, right?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:13.880
You dared defy me of all people,
so now repent as you wail out!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.380
You don't frighten me.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:16.920
Huh?

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.540
You can't begin to compare with my instructor!

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:22.920
You little...!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.330
You're just Melida... Just Melida... Just Melida...

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:30.040
Why the hell did you awaken to mana now of all times?!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.040
That's the girl, right?

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.500
Oh, that's who everyone's talking about.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.670
So you're that much-talked-about
"incompetent talented girl," huh?

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.960
It's alright if you don't have mana.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:48.130
I'll still be your friend for good.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.830
Happy to hear it! Thanks!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.630
You should've just stayed exactly like that!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:01.420
You should've remained my
friend and not kicked up a fuss!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.710
That was what...

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:06.080
That was just what you deserved!

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:16.960
I'm going to make it so that
you can't even lift up a spoon.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:18.960
Garrick Ham-

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.670
Phantom-Blade Flash...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:23.960
Wind Fang!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.210
That was a phantom-blade technique!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.250
She did that after watching me use such a skill just once?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.170
So she trained over and over again in secret, did she?

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:52.000
I'll be borrowing this.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:53.540
I don't think so!

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.790
Go now, Melida Angel!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.330
We'll handle things here.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.670
Not so fast!

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:03.460
Quickly now!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.580
Go, Melida!

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.630
Ah, Instructor!

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.920
Did you see that?!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:29.880
I...

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.380
Brilliantly done, milady.

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.380
You exceeded my expectations.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.790
I-Instructor! I'm no longer a child, you know.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.460
F-Father...

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:51.750
Father!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.420
I-I won!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.630
For the very first time, I won!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.000
I was watching.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.130
Don't get too excited after a single victory.

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.210
Before saying such a thing,

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:09.790
first prove yourself all-conquering
in a match against another school.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.710
Milady, aren't you glad?

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.170
No, not really.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.500
Please, think about what just happened.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:35.880
Today, you worked up the courage
to speak to the master of the house.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.580
And, although his response wasn't the one you desired,

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.750
he did indeed respond to you.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.920
That is a big step forward.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.250
Instructor...

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.210
Melida Angel!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.380
Nerva?!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.670
I've finished reading this, so I'm returning it.

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:01.790
I'm sorry.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.880
Leaving that aside, isn't the next match starting soon?

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.460
Ah! Oh, dear!

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.500
That's Lady Elise for you.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.130
You must be joking. In a mere 13 seconds?!

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.460
So this is the power of a Paladin?

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:39.040
Elli...?

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:18.580
Oh, boy... good grief.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:23.330
This place stinks of Nectar, and I'm growing sick of it.

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.670
Melida Angel...

00:23:32.130 --> 00:23:35.250
That girl's no Paladin.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.830
